  "title": "On the Gram determinants of the Specht modules Linda Hoyer \u2217",
  "authors_raw": "Lehrstuhl f\u00fcr Algebra und Zahlentheorie, RWTH Aachen University",
  "title_lines": [
   "On the Gram determinants of the Specht modules",
   "Linda Hoyer \u2217"
  ],
  "abstract": "For every partition\u03bb of a positive integern, letS\u03bb be the corresponding Specht module of the symmetric group Sn, and let det(\u03bb)\u2208 Z denote the Gram determinant of the canonical bilinear form with respect to the standard basis ofS\u03bb. Writing det(\u03bb) = m\u00b7 2a(2) \u03bb for integersa(2) \u03bb andm withm odd, we show that if the dimension ofS\u03bb is even, thena(2) \u03bb is also even. This confirms a conjecture posed by Richard Parker in the special case of the symmetric groups.",
